Author
------

Carlo Poggi <carlo.poggi@iter.org>
    ITER Organization
    Original design and implementation: simulation engine, geometry handling,
    particle sources, EM tracking, interaction physics, output and reporting,
    graphical user interface.


Contributors
------------

David Atteln
    HTWK Leipzig (student placement at the ITER Organization, 2026)
    Beamlet jitter in the EM tracker, face-normal checking in the result
    smoother, smoothing parameters exposed through the configuration file and
    GUI, post-smoothing workflow, energy-conserving "physical" smoothing with
    per-cell error estimate.


Adding yourself
---------------

Contributions are welcome — see CONTRIBUTING.md. Please add yourself to the
Contributors section in the same change that introduces your contribution.
